                                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch fa-spin mr-2"></i> Memuat analitik grafik omset...
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-fintech-darkBorder/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
