                            <span>Keuntungan Bersih (Net)</span>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-coins text-amber-500 text-base"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 id="fin-net-profit" class="text-2xl font-black font-mono text-fintech-blue dark:text-sky-400">
