                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left text-fintech-blue"></i>
                                <span>Riwayat Mutasi & Settlement GoPay Terkini</span>
                            </h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 dark:text-fintech-darkSubtext">Penerimaan dana resmi yang tercatat di rekening merchant GoBiz</p>
